  "requirement": "When `habeas add-input` creates or refreshes evidence, it MUST also capture or refresh the definition inputs required by the resulting record, including dependencies of its subject text and all reviewed inputs.\n\nRepeated references MUST NOT create duplicate definition inputs. Any change to the record MUST leave its determination false pending reassessment. If no inputs or other record contents change, the record MUST remain unchanged.",
  "determination": true,
  "rationale": "update_inputs computes and captures transitive definition dependencies after applying requested inputs. It collapses duplicate definition selectors and uses the existing pending-determination transition only on changes. cyclic_dependencies_are_captured_once_and_changes_require_review verifies byte-for-byte idempotence, refresh, and duplicate repair."
}
